:: OC Shinju Felix Lucas Soccer Match [nobr]

/* Intro */
You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> enjoy some time hanging from the money bars, getting your workout in by dangling and flailing about as you chat. <span style="color:LightGreen">It is rather relaxing and you are both seated atop the bars</span> <span style="color:Yellow">when a soccer ball suddenly comes flying towards you!</span> <br>

