<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Look out!”</span> A voice calls out as both you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> duck in sync, narrowly dodging the projectile of a ball. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sorry about that, overshot the net a little bit.”</span> The owner of the voice runs over, though you already knew who it was thanks to the thick accent and the fact that he can be found where soccer is being played. Your French classmate, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span>. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, hey <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$FelixNickname</span>, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>. Sorry about that, things got a little… intense?”</span> He laughs nervously, running to grab the soccer ball as another voice chimes in. <br>

