    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sorry, not sorry. Unlike some, I play to win, no matter the cost!”</span> It is <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span>, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>’ white-haired rival and the occasional partner of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span>. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Had it been my kick, it would have gone in the goal.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I don’t know, seems kind of on-brand for your kick to aim for my face.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> responds with a hint of annoyance, generally finding <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span>’s one-sided rivalry infuriating, though still engaging out of pride. Both boys glare at each other as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> returns with the ball, both of you looking at the hostile staring contest with confusion. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Right, well-”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> clears his throat, trying to break the tension. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Want to join us for a game? A little two-on-two?”</span> <br>

