    <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Why would I? Monsters don’t wear clothes. I only wear this to avoid annoying questions.”</span> <span style="color:Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> lifts up the front of his hoodie, exposing his bare crotch, and swinging his hips back and forth teasingly. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Like what you see? I’m pretty sure I felt some tongue there, hero boy!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> laughs as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> turns even redder; rage mixed with humiliation. Normally, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> would be more embarrassed than upset, but <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> knows exactly how to push his buttons.</span> <br>
